### User register
POST https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"Anju",
    "lastName":"B",
    "email":"anju@gmail.com",
    "password":"abc12345",
    "profileImageUrl":"https://example.com.avatars.author.png"

}



### User Login
POST  https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/common-api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"anju@gmail.com",
    "password":"abc12345"
}


