### Create Article
POST https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"69afe29c022454c01bc2404d",
    "title":"t2 article",
    "category":"programming",
    "content":"content of t2 article"
}


###Read articles of a author
GET https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/author-api/articles/69ae881108ae581e3f3eb618


### Update article (AUTHOR)
PUT  https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"69ae881108ae581e3f3eb618",
    "articleId":"69ae8ad4d776712162120ef6",
    "title":"test1 article",
    "category":"programming",
    "content":"content of test 1 article"
}



### User Comment to an article
PUT  https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/user-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"69ae881108ae581e3f3eb618",
    "articleId":"69ae8ad4d776712162120ef6",
    "comment":"first comment"
}


### Admin Blocks a user
POST https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/admin-api/blockuser/698ac0e0086ba22f46410905
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"698ab9dfbcc6b95ee0fa6389",
    "role":"USER"
}

### Admin Unblock a user
POST https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/admin-api/unblockuser/698ac0e0086ba22f46410905
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId":"698ab9dfbcc6b95ee0fa6389",
    "role":"USER"   
}

### Change passwords of a user
PUT https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/common-api/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "Anusha@gmail.com",
  "currpassword": "abcd",
  "newpassword": "anusha"
}


### Logout
GET https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/common-api/logout


### Delete an article
PATCH https://mern-23eg105v53.onrender.com/author-api/articles/69ae8ad4d776712162120ef6/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isArticleActive": true }